{"id": "738161194347912"}, "iarc_email": null, "msrp": null, "translations": {"nodes": [{"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1074030017069025", "locale": "cs_CZ", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "NeuroBoostVR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "\ud83d\ude80 Zv\u00fd\u0161te \u017eivotn\u00fd \u0161t\u00fdl s NeuroBoostVR! \n\ud83e\udde0 Pre akt\u00edvny mozog a inovat\u00edvne cvi\u010denie je tu NeuroBoostVR! Virtu\u00e1lna realita pre Oculus Quest vylep\u0161uje jemn\u00fa motoriku, rovnov\u00e1hu a orient\u00e1ciu.\n\n\ud83c\udf08 Pre\u010do NeuroBoostVR? \n\u2705 Denn\u00e1 rutina v novom svete: Cvi\u010dte mozog a nervov\u00fd syst\u00e9m v z\u00e1bavn\u00fdch \u00faloh\u00e1ch a cvi\u010deniach. \n\u2705 Personalizovan\u00e9 tr\u00e9ningy: Vyberte cvi\u010denia pre motoriku, rovnov\u00e1hu a orient\u00e1ciu. \n\u2705 Z\u00e1bava v ka\u017edej \u00falohe: Chy\u0165te mot\u00fdle, otvorte trezor, cho\u010fte po moste a in\u00e9 \u00falohy pre rados\u0165 z ka\u017edodenn\u00fdch aktiv\u00edt.\n\n\ud83c\udf0d Presu\u0148te svet do virtu\u00e1lnej reality: S NeuroBoostVR cvi\u010d\u00edte doma s fyzickou a ment\u00e1lnou stimul\u00e1ciou. \n\ud83d\udc75\ud83c\udffd\ud83d\udc74\ud83c\udffd Pre seniorov s neurologick\u00fdmi probl\u00e9my: NeuroBoostVR zlep\u0161uje denn\u00e9 zru\u010dnosti v virtu\u00e1lnej realite.\n\n\ud83d\udca1 Vst\u00fapte do sveta inov\u00e1ci\u00ed s NeuroBoostVR! Stiahnite si na Oculus Quest pre nov\u00fd rozmer cvi\u010denia! \ud83d\udd25", "short_description": "\ud83d\ude80 Zv\u00fd\u0161te \u017eivotn\u00fd \u0161t\u00fdl s NeuroBoostVR! \n\n\ud83e\udde0 Pre akt\u00edvny mozog a inovat\u00edvne cvi\u010denie je tu NeuroBoostVR! Virtu\u00e1lna realita pre Oculus Quest vylep\u0161uje jemn\u00fa motoriku, rovnov\u00e1hu a orient\u00e1ciu.\n\n\ud83d\udc75\ud83c\udffd\ud83d\udc74\ud83c\udffd Pre seniorov s neurologick\u00fdmi probl\u00e9my: NeuroBoostVR zlep\u0161uje denn\u00e9 zru\u010dnosti v virtu\u00e1lnej realite.\n"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "icon.png", "id": "3715489735443944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75223475_3715489738777277_6725514994967281094_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NGwxQBah6oAQ7kNvwHA1Xwr&_nc_oc=Ado-AFVu4Bq_3qZ-9WkhpYZgOwuuRKtEB5jv9YcuvVdEchBDEwhCEoVW_Qm034sGnS4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNJmIlUb0zmfwfnuAq60RgcvoVTjZ5TGTzGOKy5R6LJPQ&oe=6AE5E27A"}, {"file_name": "NeuroBoostVR-logos_white.png", "id": "1449299835652595", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031588_1449299838985928_3273656360243060538_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vAP0dnmjhj8Q7kNvwHmGAGz&_nc_oc=AdrLc981GOLhZ8JQYF4bzdryivRNknLl_y1HMIJp8inWFEMpF8mfEOgh6QTMq-VIJlI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQP4ux9nAR6nfKcXvyLgSjaJgo7xcORXsV8xdQqs0wVZLQ&oe=6AE5E3E3"}, {"file_name": "square.png", "id": "914639506755776", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982453_914639510089109_4964949883562545877_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oAiBaZyXJ6MQ7kNvwFI5JEb&_nc_oc=Adoz_afZuwW59LcsSUxV49Q-rdfNUDHW6cN4dx4uUewhxmAhgK25hdTNt6bPl0DHgXE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOshvhUwRwLFV_aSIEhYDHSOr9Vi4Gjl_JF2w2olkNQng&oe=6AE5E36B"}, {"file_name": "mini_landscape.png", "id": "708521497648808", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974893_708521500982141_5155930483829372086_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Y0a9Pk7xomcQ7kNvwE3teSm&_nc_oc=Ado5L_Bub18Wg9yzDKyflPliZPRZM8o0O4Bb7Sb0B1OP9W_BS4zuS31D7Us-cP49NkI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPEhPUQl_tfizxeTq17WURbBVqpqtTwLsxaqOomszxrpg&oe=6AE617E1"}, {"file_name": "portrait.pn